       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PERFUNTIL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-I PIC 9(3) VALUE 1.
       01 WS-SUM PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM WITH TEST AFTER UNTIL WS-I > 5
               COMPUTE WS-SUM = WS-SUM + WS-I
               COMPUTE WS-I = WS-I + 1
           END-PERFORM.
           DISPLAY WS-SUM.
           STOP RUN.
